
# WOVEN documents (Þættir, plan 174): a merge conflict is answered by re-weaving.
FEATURES.md merge=regenerate
bin/README.md merge=regenerate
# The register is a TREE (plan 211): a folder's rows live in bin/<folder>/INDEX.md and a
# capability fragment, so a hand touches ONE fragment and never the front door. The fragments
# deliberately take a normal text merge — a conflict inside one folder is two hands in the same
# folder, which is a meeting worth having, not a collision to paper over.
.agents/backend/README.md merge=regenerate
.agents/assets/agents/capabilities.md merge=regenerate
